  "title": "Williams Announces Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "TULSA, Okla. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 28, 2026-- Williams’ (NYSE: WMB) board of directors has approved a regular dividend of $0.525 per share, or $2.10 annualized, on the company’s common stock, payable on Sept. 28, 2026, to holders of record at the close of business on Sept. 11, 2026.",
